Methodological Interpretation:
  [MODERATE-TO-HIGH DOMAIN SHIFT]: Domain classifier AUROC is 0.6794 (significantly above 0.50).
  This indicates that post-2016 data exhibits systematic non-random distribution shifts in target drugs, genes, or sequence positions relative to pre-2016 data.
  Therefore, temporal validation performance reflects both temporal generalization AND domain shift across experimental eras.